## Experiment Objectives

The objectives of this experiment are:

1. To implement the given workload using Sequential execution.
2. To implement the workload using OpenMP.
3. To implement the workload using MPI.
4. To implement the workload using CUDA.
5. To compare the execution performance of the different approaches.
6. To understand the architectural differences between the computing models.

